<title>USA: U.S. Robotics,3Com proxy OKd.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics,3Com proxy OKd.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp and 3Com Corp said on Tuesday that the final proxy statement for their proposed merger has been declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The proxy has been mailed to shareholders, who are scheduled to meet June 11. The companies said the SEC declared the proxy effective on May 8.</p>
<p>Under the deal, 3Com, which manufactures computer network equipment, plans to buy modem maker U.S. Robotics for $6.6 billion.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
